Date:   Sat Nov 14 08:08:16 2026 +0800

    Run the projection consumer in the hidden-input session mode
    
    The diagnostic production test now also runs the hidden-input entry: the
    plaintext weights and outputs leave the verifier plan, the sampled index-mask
    message and the shown-map message join the session, and the session commits
    its reduced rows instead of taking them as plan values. The real verified
    activation rows of the layer-0 key projection, the real weight table and all
    sixteen positions are used. A missing sampled index-mask message and a changed
    table identity are rejected by the same plan and prover.
    
    This is still a session composition on verified production values, not the
    production proof wiring; the activation commitment is a plan-pinned object and
    the cross-object checks remain the next step.

